@startuml "Chain of Responsibility - Expense (Solution) - Class Diagram"
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Each link decides, or passes the expense on
abstract class ExpenseHandler <<Handler>> {
  - next : ExpenseHandler
  + then(ExpenseHandler) : ExpenseHandler
  + handle(Expense) : String
  # tryToHandle(Expense) : String
}
class Approver <<ConcreteHandler>> {
  - name : String
  - limit : int
}
class AuditLog <<ConcreteHandler>>
class Expense <<record>>
ExpenseHandler <|-- Approver
ExpenseHandler <|-- AuditLog
note bottom of Approver
  <b>Within my limit, and not my own.</b>
  Otherwise the next link decides.
end note
note bottom of AuditLog
  Records every expense,
  and always passes it on.
end note
ExpenseHandler -[norank]-> "0..1" ExpenseHandler : next
ExpenseHandler .[norank].> Expense
@enduml
